  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards Better Management of Disaster Displacement and Increased Resilience of Refugees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to work towards better management of disaster displacement and increased resilience by ensuring coordination through the Bangladesh&apos;s Disaster Management Committee, strengthening disaster risk reduction, and management in the Rohingya refugee camps, and continuing the operation of the Humanitarian Access Working Group to understand the impact of humanitarian agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
